  "content": "# Lux V1\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patreon.com/techthedev\"><img src=\"https://intellitonic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"300\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://discord.gg/eZ6GpXQXGC\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/853294489636831242?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=ffffff&color=5865f2&link=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FuBhFaBG\" style=\"height: 50px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://twitter.com/TheRealTechDev\"><img alt=\"X（原 Twitter）追蹤\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/TheRealTechDev?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=black&labelColor=white&color=%23101013\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/lux-shaders\"><img alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/863609?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=%23f16436&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/lux-v1\"><img alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/DiGQENDV?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=%2316a869&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n![Imgur](https://imgur.com/p2kIQGi.jpg)\n\nLux 是一款基於 [Capt Tatsu 的 BSL 光影](https://bitslablab.com \"Takes you to the BSL Website\") 的高擬真 Minecraft Java 版光影包。\n\n預設情況下，Lux 針對中高階使用者設計，但也提供廣泛的設定選項，讓你能打造專屬於自己的光影。\n在力求相容於各種硬體與軟體規格的同時，兼顧美觀與遊戲體驗，Lux 也整合了實驗性與罕見的功能。\n它持續頻繁更新，並仍為此領域的新進者，但正因如此採用更現代的技術來呈現優異的視覺效果，是一款絕對不容錯過的光影包。\n\n## 錯誤回報\n\n若遇到任何問題，請使用 [GitHub 問題追蹤器](https://github.com/TechDevOnGitHub/Lux-Shader/issues)。",
